              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu iltung'ana ooing'uaa iloreren pooki aainining engeno nagut e Solomon, o looing'uaa ilaiguanak pooki le nkop, ootoning'oitie engeno nagut e Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
